          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Doubtful, but <i>our</i> victory is close. Across this river lies the abandoned sanctuary, and within lies an artifact that can destroy Mal-Ravanal once and for all. That is the object of our quest."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("This area was deserted whence last I came, but I have heard rumors that a flight of drakes has taken up residence."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("Wolves and drakes, bah! I fear no mindless beasts!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Unlike yourself, drakes are very much intelligent. Their inner flame guards against our mages’ fire and their flight will serve them better than our feet amidst these snow-covered mountains."),
          },
